      "comment": "REDEEM A ARCADIA (7) carved over from wide out and boxed on strongly to finish 2 lengths away in second (17.73) behind BARRELLED at this track. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from an outside draw. Winning claims. ZIPPING AMOS (6) crossed over from out wide last start before finishing second (17.61) at this track in a Grade 5 over 300m. Speedy beginner who can find the front despite the tricky draw. Can feature again. BARRELLED (3) was unfancied latest when jumping from this same draw but belied the odds to score (17.58) over 300m at this track in a Grade 5. With a good start should be able to take advantage of the low draw. Has the ability and looks a key chance. OUR BILL (5) cannot be ruled out.",
